  "description": "Dataset: C21_T28_LGA. Core activity need for assistance by age by sex time series data for Local Government Area 2021 (LGA 2021 boundaries), 2021 Census, Count of persons (excludes overseas visitors).\nThis table is based on place of usual residence.\nMeasures the number of people with a profound or severe core activity limitation. People with a profound or severe core activity limitation are those needing assistance in their day to day lives in one or more of the three core activity areas of self-care, mobility and communication because of a long-term health condition (lasting six months or more), a disability (lasting six months or more), or old age. \nPlease note that there are small random adjustments made to all cell values to protect the confidentiality of data. These adjustments may cause the sum of rows or columns to differ by small amounts from table totals.",
